sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Login or Profile
    participant BE as Auth API
    participant G as Google Identity Services
    participant DB as Database
    alt Explicit local-account link
        U->>FE: Open settings and confirm current password
        FE->>BE: POST profile/google/link-challenge
        BE->>DB: Check local credential, first-password-change and authVersion
        BE-->>FE: LINK challenge bound to user ID
    else Google login
        FE->>BE: POST auth/google/challenge
        BE-->>FE: LOGIN challenge, nonce and secret
    end
    FE->>G: Render Google button with nonce
    U->>G: Select Google identity
    G-->>FE: Signed ID token
    FE->>BE: Token, challenge ID and secret
    BE->>BE: Verify signature, claims and nonce
    BE->>DB: Lock challenge then active Gmail whitelist
    alt Outside whitelist
        BE-->>FE: 403 ACCOUNT_NOT_IN_SYSTEM
    else Active whitelist
        BE->>DB: Check subject and owner; lock existing user if needed
        alt LINK and identity owned by another user
            BE-->>FE: 409 GOOGLE_IDENTITY_IN_USE; no merge
        else Allowed
            BE->>DB: Bind current local user or create Google-only user on LOGIN
            BE->>DB: Consume challenge; increment authVersion on LINK
            DB-->>BE: Commit together
            BE-->>FE: AuthResponse for the same owner
        end
    end
